  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Carayaca Educational Project - Venezuela</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Coromoto2020 and the Center for Educational Innovation (CIED) of the Andres Bello Catholic University have come together to bring hope to the parish of Carayaca in the State of La Guaira in Venezuela. This pilot test will be carried out for 1 YEAR, led by a team of 10 UCAB professors. Through this alliance, we seek to provide support in socio-emotional tools and good practices in the classroom to respond to the innovation needs in teacher teaching and in student learning.</narrative>
  </description>
